                                                "sense_id": "03050e09-876e-3fdc-bf00-be11e6693013",
                                                "text": "My opinion on the subject is malleable."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d1ccb2cf-bef1-4f52-b37e-ebe656a8f8a1",
                                                "sense_id": "03050e09-876e-3fdc-bf00-be11e6693013",
                                                "text": "The psychosocial factors in this study are malleable and provide target areas for enhancing mental health in those with high levels of autistic traits."
                                            },
                                            {
